          "title": "You'll want to know: la justice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la justice — \"the justice; the courts\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La famille demande justice. The family is asking for justice."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La justice is also the legal system: aller en justice."
            }
          ]
        },
